  "description": "Built around our new Four-bar linkage frame with up-to-date geometry and proprietary X6 aluminum tubing, the new Shift R9 is the ultimate ride-anywhere-ride-anything Enduro model. With a steeper seat tube angle for more efficient pedaling plus a slacker head tube angle and longer reach for an improved attack position, the Shift R9 will satisfy a wide range of riders. With 160mm of rear travel and 170mm of front suspension provided by Rockshox, the Shift R9, with its new Shimano XT and SLX 12-speed components, allows for a smooth ride up or down the hills, under the clock or not, with a wide-range gear ratio and precise, crisp shifting.\nNew MY20 X6 alloy 4-Bar Linkage frame, 27.5\" Enduro geometry, 160mm rear travel, Boost thru-axle dropouts\nRockshox Super Deluxe Select R Trunnion rear shock w/ reservoir\nRockShox Yari RC 27.5\" Boost fork, 35mm, 170mm travel\nPraxis Cadet forged crankset, M30 Axle, w/ 32T alloy chainring\nNew Shimano XT 12-spd rear derailleur\nNew SLX 12-spd shifter & 10-51T cassette\nWTB ST Light i-29 27.5\" rims w/ 2.0 TCS rim tape, tubeless ready\nNew Kenda Nevegal-2 27.5x2.6\" tires, 120 tpi, Aramid Beads\nShimano MT 520/501 4-piston disc brakes\nX-fusion Manic 150 / 125mm internal dropper post & remote",
